/v/t64.5771-25/75411995_851017809663063_5980842994367295165_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hAxsGqrkp6cQ7kNvwESockh&_nc_oc=Adp6OSew2ySOOhRoXMEx1Ku9WAs4F3mTxQ0tY56weRq57rzDLUe7m4u3fP5_dB6Trbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af685YEByVxTJ0LsFEMmHcENH2_pfzFtq_H2PEWPXp16JQ&oe=6A1999F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Skid_Steer_Screenshot_02.png", "id": "2987144918082406", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982478_2987144921415739_879162249994641493_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CZqvTNYYqcYQ7kNvwG-DMX6&_nc_oc=AdqGgVaLfXnd1o7uIVeEPG5PygAKmrcwkFAsHO-apX1JelaSQ8VnASQIxdO5wr2mCts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5DcF1WzaTcoYEBHS2Bf_67HgSVXzex3xDxiPfO_KT3pA&oe=6A19BEC2"}, "display_name": "Skid Steer Safety & Operation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The skid steer loader is a highly versatile vehicle commonly used in construction, manufacturing, and engineering projects. Its compact size, powerful engine, and wide range of attachments for lifting, digging, and moving earth make it a popular choice among workers on the job site. Participants will operate a skid steer to complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of the engaging simulation.\n\nOverview & Activities:\nParticipants begin with an overview that provides context and helps identify key parts and components outside and inside the vehicle, safety tips, and the basics of a walk-around inspection performed before using any heavy machinery. Then, participants engage in a sort-and-match activity to reinforce which central controls and steps are required to start the vehicle. Next, they are asked to perform a task to familiarize themselves with operating the vehicle in a VR environment. Embedded learning outcomes based on Bloom\u2019s revised taxonomy include remembering, understanding, and applying.\n\nParticipant Simulation:\nThe interactive and manipulative simulation allows participants to explore, learn, and practice operating a skid-steer in a safe and realistic format. Before beginning their tasks, participants must don personal protective equipment (PPE) and conduct a walk-around inspection of the vehicle. Finally, participants are challenged to complete a series of tasks at an active worksite. ", "short_description": "The skid steer loader is a highly versatile vehicle commonly used in construction, manufacturing, and engineering projects. Its compact size, powerful engine, and wide range of attachments for lifting, digging, and moving earth make it a popular choice among workers on the job site. Participants will operate a skid steer to complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of the engaging simulation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6623098031093370"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24011337895176114"